{"translation-revision-date":"2023-09-20 12:00:00+00:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/index.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en_US","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Carbonfooter":["Carbonfooter"],"Settings":[""],"Carbonfooter.nl":["Carbon Footprint"],"How green is this webpage?":[""],"YES":[""],"page size":["Page Title"],"per visit":[""],"to offset per year":[""],"Yes!":[""],"NO!":[""],"Your website runs on green energy.":[""],"Your website does not run on green energy.":[""],"Greenhost":["Green hosting:"],"Greenhost status":["Green hosting:"],"Emissions":["Emissions"],"Average page emissions":[""],"Emissions per year.":["Emissions"],"Driving distance":[""],"Per year.":[""],"tree":[""],"trees":[""],"Trees":[""],"Plant %1$s %2$s":[""],"To offset your emissions.":[""],"These statistics are based on 1,000 visitors per month, each viewing 2.5 average pages, over a 12-month period.":[""],"Page title":["Page Title"],"Actions":["Actions"],"Edit":["Edit"],"View":["View"],"Emissions per page - from dirty to clean":[""],"No pages with emissions data found.":["No pages with emissions data found."],"Resource type":[""],"Avg. Requests per page":[""],"Avg. size of resources per page":[""],"Resource Statistics":[""],"Average resource usage across your posts and pages.":[""],"Last test on":[""],"Overview":[""],"This page produced":["This page produced %1$s per page view."],"per page view. Measure more?":["This page produced %1$s per page view. Measure more? %2$s"],"Results are measured with":[""],"carbonfooter":["Carbonfooter"],"It runs on green energy":[""],"emits":[""],"= same as a":[""],"drive":[""],"Takes":[""],"per page view.":[""],"g CO2 \/ visit \u2014":[""],"How Measurements Work":[""],"Carbonfooter automatically measures the carbon emission of your pages: ":[""],"Measurements are taken when someone visits a page that hasn\u2019t been measured in the last week.":[""],"Each page stores up to 12 historical measurements, providing about 3 months of history":[""],"The process runs in the background and won\u2019t affect your visitors\u2019 experience (except ofcourse they see the carbon footprint in the footer!)":[""],"The methodology of the carbon calculation is based on the universal Sustainable Web Model version 4, improved for Dutch visitors.":[""],"Read more about how it works":[""],"Export Historical Emissions Data":[""],"This is especially relevant if you want to use the carbon emissions from your website for another platform. You can export all historical emissions as a JSON file. This includes all pages with measurement history, including the serialized PHP arrays that contain the historical measurements. ":[""],"The exported file will contain:":[""],"Post ID and title":[""],"Complete measurement history":[""],"Serialized PHP arrays with dates and values":[""],"All pages with historical data":["No pages with emissions data found."],"Exporting Data...":[""],"Export Historical Data":[""],"Danger zone - Reset all Carbonfooter data":[""],"This will permanently delete all CarbonFooter data including:":[""],"All emissions measurements":[""],"Resource usage data":[""],"Measurement history":["Measured by"],"Page size data":[""],"Green hosting status":["Green hosting:"],"Clearing Data...":[""],"Clear All CarbonFooter Data":[""],"Troubleshooting: not working?":[""],"Don't see any data? Try these things:":[""],"Visit your webpage: The measuring updates automatically when somebody visits the web page. So, visit your webpage, and wait a few minutes.":[""],"Clear your cache: Still not working after 30 minutes? This might be because you are using a caching plugin.":[""],"We ran a check and detected that your website is using the following caching plugin(s):":["We detected the following caching plugin(s): %1$s."],"Clear your cache, and refresh your webpage. If you are using LiteSpeed Cache, you need to clear the cache manually after every measurement.":[""],"We ran a check and detected that your website is not using any of the common caching plugins.":[""],"Clear your cache, and refresh your webpage.":[""],"Improve your website: possibly your web page is too heavy to go through our calculation. Go to":[""],"check our tips, update your webpage and try again.":[""],"If that also doesn't work, it is possible that your web page is too heavy to go through our calculation. Go to carbonfooter.nl, check our tips, update your webpage and try again.":[""],"Visit Carbonfooter":[""],"Hang on while we are preparing your carbonfooter":[""],"The emissions for your home page have been calculated.":[""],"Close modal":[""],"We are measuring your carbon footprint":[""],"We are measuring the carbon footprint of your home page. This may take 30 seconds.":[""],"Per visit it will emit %s of CO2.":[""],"There was an error calculating the emissions for your home page. Please visit the page to trigger re-measurement.":[""],"Back to settings":[""],"Arrow right":[""],"View your homepage":[""],"Carbonfooter widget settings have been saved.":[""],"There was an error saving the carbonfooter widget settings.":[""],"Failed to save display settings. Please try again.":[""],"Failed to save widget style. Please try again.":[""],"Failed to save settings. Please try again.":[""],"Thank you for joining us in our quest to make the internet more sustainable. With this plugin, you can calculate and display the carbon footprint of your website in the footprint. Follow these steps to set up your own carbonfooter! ":[""],"Step 1 - Design your carbonfooter":[""],"Define your style":[""],"Layout":[""],"Minimal":[""],"Minimal: only one line of text showing the CO2 value of the web page.":[""],"Full Banner":[""],"Full banner: shows 5 icons and more detailed information on the sustainability of the web page":[""],"Sticker":[""],"Sticker: compact sticker-style badge perfect to fit into a corner of your web page.":[""],"Label":[""],"Label: subtle badge. Shortcode only \u2014 use [carbonfooter style=\"label\"] (not available for automatic display).":[""],"Background color":[""],"Text color":[""],"Live Preview":[""],"This is what your carbonfooter will look like:":[""],"Save your design":[""],"Step 2. Show your carbonfooter":[""],"You can choose if you want to show your carbonfooter automatically or manually. Don\u2019t know which one to choose? Start with the automatic display, and if that one doesn\u2019t show in the proper place, switch to the manual mode.":[""],"Display automatically":[""],"The carbonfooter will be shown automatically on all pages at the end of your footer. Works fine with most themes.":[""],"Add manually":[""],"The carbonfooter will be shown after you added the shortcode to your footer (or any other widget or textfield).":[""],"Copy and paste the shortcode below, including the brackets, to your footer or any widget \/ textfield. The shortcode will automatically use the layout and colors you\u2019ve configured above.":[""],"Save Display Settings":[""],"Step 3. You're all set!":[""],"Great! Your homepage has already been measured. You can view the results on your homepage.":[""],"You can start measuring, showing and reducing your footprint.":[""],"Start measuring now":[""],"Besides showing the carbonfooterprint in the footer, you will now see an extra column behind each post and page that shows the carbon emissions generated when someone visits the page.":[""],"Information & tools":[""],"Data is exported successfully.":[""],"Failed to export data. Please try again.":[""],"Are you sure you want to clear all CarbonFooter data? This action cannot be undone and will remove all emissions measurements, resource data, and history. Your settings will be preserved.":[""],"Failed to clear data. Please try again.":[""],"Dismiss":[""],"Error loading data":[""],"Failed to load untested pages":[""],"Failed to load heaviest pages":["Top 10 Heaviest Pages"],"Title":["Page Title"],"Pages Overview":[""],"Loading pages data...":[""],"Untested Pages":[""],"Visit & calculate emissions":[""],"All pages have been tested for emissions!":[""]}}}